<title>POLAND: TONSIL AUG NET SWINGS TO LOSS PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>TONSIL AUG NET SWINGS TO LOSS PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.19 vs   0.01 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.24 vs   0.01 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.26 vs   0.42 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    4.85 vs   4.51</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.15 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.15 vs   0.40</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.56 vs   2.70</p>
<p> Sales		   39.12 vs  33.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish speaker-systems maker is</p>
<p>Tonsil SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
